ce to the base. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/bd81ebd17f2a7168bb3ee6dc49f0047f.poster.avif?t=1724993955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/bd81ebd17f2a7168bb3ee6dc49f0047f.webm?t=1724993955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/bd81ebd17f2a7168bb3ee6dc49f0047f.mp4?t=1724993955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Make something really crazy</u></h2>Play in various odd game modes such as Total Diarrhea, Froggy, etc.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/e48ed36cff75363d6ef8f1f1107f34d8.poster.avif?t=1724993955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/e48ed36cff75363d6ef8f1f1107f34d8.webm?t=1724993955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/e48ed36cff75363d6ef8f1f1107f34d8.mp4?t=1724993955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Relax and have fun</u></h2>If you are tired of carrying and throwing objects, you can make your colleagues dance or run to help you cope with the correction of office architecture.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/36dcf391d6a4ea3fff5b874d47fc3b91.poster.avif?t=1724993955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/36dcf391d6a4ea3fff5b874d47fc3b91.webm?t=1724993955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140880/extras/36dcf391d6a4ea3fff5b874d47fc3b91.mp4?t=1724993955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Me in the Office is a comedy destruction game where you can destroy the large three-floor office in different ways. In this game you are anything but a regular employee in an office. Throw furniture, smash glass, raise a fuss or make employees dance - do anything you want, no one will fire you!",
